      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "generally to provide a good user experience, any \"reset\" or \"delete\" action should have a confirmation, or be easily undone if pressed by mistake. (ideally both)\n\nthe hierarchy of these actions should also be considered; in VRChat, often these options are right next to frequently-used actions (Action Menu), or are the most prominent button in the menu (Quick Menu Expressions Wing)\n\n- ideally, reset actions should be placed somewhere accessible, but not frequently accessed -> out of sight until needed, not nested among the day-to-day actions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
